  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many face tracking packages build non-destructively at upload time using tools like Triturbo's BlendShare, meaning the face tracking blendshapes are not actually on the avatar yet while it's being set up in Unity. These blendshapes therefore cannot be selected as targets in the avatar descriptor. Please allow free-text arbitrary blendshape names so these packages can be supported.",
